{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香港想養狗不容易，不少私人屋苑都不准養狗，更遑論公屋和居屋。不過近日韓國街頭與社交平台掀起一股「遛紙狗」熱潮，當地不少小朋友或年輕人手執細繩，牽著一隻用紙摺出來的小狗在大街上散步；只要輕輕向前拉，紙狗的四肢更會順著步伐前後擺動，行路姿勢生動逼真。影片在Threads、YouTube 及Instagram等平台瘋傳洗版，有香港網民更指過去周日有人在南豐紗廠遛「狗」。</p><figure><img alt=\"YouTube截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199021426259005440627534.jpeg/YAtvDxvVhRO1PVPothqTq0DIyfwxmEGR_Lix1vy4sdY\"/><figcaption>YouTube截圖</figcaption></figure><p>韓網封為「完美寵物」：唔吠唔甩毛、免睇獸醫</p><p>這款手作在韓國被稱為「종이강아지」（紙小狗）。這股熱潮所以極速爆紅，因為它完美擊中無數「想養狗卻受現實所限」之痛。不少人因租屋禁令、家人反對、過敏體質等原因而無法養狗，而紙小狗不單不需要餵食、不會隨地大小便、不用睇獸醫，更絕對不會吠叫和甩毛。</p><figure><img alt=\"threads截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199021861225107456317025.jpeg/k31JL2UgcqXzEvtlq0_xHajfNsx_j8ThqqxJx6qsScc\"/><figcaption>threads截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"threads截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199021863414665216593872.jpeg/0Q7ZXOcACo2xU8_8pGa-4tV2xd4kkt7ffHPSB3xz0gc\"/><figcaption>threads截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"threads截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199021865654554624704532.jpeg/Re3--T9_otyuXNM8ea7DYuhg07KiEmbo4n5rH-J-ax8\"/><figcaption>threads截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"threads截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199021867818946560874391.jpeg/0cTphNlh8LRMsXWaMsGmCGFwTZdHZCM7ssqQKLLKkCg\"/><figcaption>threads截圖</figcaption></figure><p>大批韓國網民笑言這是「阿媽唯一點頭批准養的狗」，更稱其為「完美寵物」。甚至有網民親自為自己的紙狗取名為「泡菜」，直呼終於能體驗帶狗散步的快樂！此外，紙小狗造型完全由主人發揮，網上除了常見的白色長毛犬、短腿臘腸犬外，甚至連《蠟筆小新》的「小白」以及《吉伊卡哇》的「小八」都被網民神還原。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199021755633504256098216.jpeg/oHYyWcqZVCCNx4_TxO9uNduTNQpDPFGH_AG_FPwBvxQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199021758020194304238754.jpeg/RsJ7r0Bl7V6ZH1vfyGNPRfooapK3szlCVxApMFcQKTA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199021760172003328702894.jpeg/axLyf0vh_9t9YzOToew5j4smKUR_P1F_9GwZG_RsGRs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199021762340589568328014.jpeg/lx9doi2IvpRu4uBHKof5xI5IPos0ain38nS7-fJ0u_k\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199021764391735296690748.jpeg/0KF4rEWsXmfrJIPne9ZMpaa5z072EH-mDyDg4w8g4OM\"/><p>這股「遛紙狗」熱潮也吹到香港。近日有網民在threads上發短片，指在荃灣南豐紗廠看到有人放紙狗，更留言指「會不會太q」。由於南豐紗廠是「放狗」聖地，有狗隻見紙小狗甚為好奇，更上前探索。不少網民均大讚場面搞笑，「勁可愛，見到有狗狗互動」、「放紙狗狗都識得戴狗繩」、「呢啲乖過真狗太多，又唔會四圍亂屙」。</p><figure><img alt=\"有網民表示在南豐紗廠有人溜紙小狗。( threads@so.elephant)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199023720203554816429138.png/MXKQKPWc5svMuhHhviuRJ2k6W65KScecj1HLso9Ry7I\"/><figcaption>有網民表示在南豐紗廠有人溜紙小狗。( threads@so.elephant)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有網民表示在南豐紗廠有人溜紙小狗。( threads@so.elephant)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199023722539913216841396.png/fHpZgQ4g0S0EBjzv-p-eBVfp3ITouQ6s5dJ_CuXSfwo\"/><figcaption>有網民表示在南豐紗廠有人溜紙小狗。( threads@so.elephant)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有紙狗主人回覆原帖「相認」，片段中還有金毛跟紙狗同框，好Cute！（threads@christinepangyh)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199023725102764032413069.png/8gZWt9c36EgERBlbahIew0n-dLiCQ1Eyt3ppCbd6aQk\"/><figcaption>有紙狗主人回覆原帖「相認」，片段中還有金毛跟紙狗同框，好Cute！（threads@christinepangyh)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有紙狗主人回覆原帖「相認」，片段中還有金毛跟紙狗同框，好Cute！（threads@christinepangyh)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199023727518814208738241.png/efhwOL_ZHx0mrb1QUCSPcfFkZfeEotVlIa-9CyGvvQs\"/><figcaption>有紙狗主人回覆原帖「相認」，片段中還有金毛跟紙狗同框，好Cute！（threads@christinepangyh)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有紙狗主人回覆原帖「相認」，片段中還有金毛跟紙狗同框，好Cute！（threads@christinepangyh)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199023729867755520918032.png/K_9VM2G_fCSBpr_tkjpzLIMvrKNIpHry4sDNHuLAzR4\"/><figcaption>有紙狗主人回覆原帖「相認」，片段中還有金毛跟紙狗同框，好Cute！（threads@christinepangyh)</figcaption></figure><p>8張A4紙自製「會走路的紙小狗」</p><p>想擁有一隻屬於自己的小狗，製作門檻其實極低，大部分材料屋企信手拈來，以下是網民製作的教學片。</p><p>準備材料： A4紙8張、剪刀、透明膠紙（或膠水）、黑色與粉紅色筆、繩子（或緞帶），亦可準備吸管或筷子作為輔助支撐。</p><p>製作5大步驟：</p><p>製作四條腿（需4張A4紙）： 每條腿各用1張紙。將紙張對折再對折至長條的四分之一寬度，向內收合後用膠紙封住邊緣。上下兩端各剪出一個朝相反方向折的小折片以備黏合，並將腳掌一端剪成圓弧形、貼上膠紙加固。重複做法做出四條腿。</p><p>製作頭部（需1張A4紙）： 紙張上下兩側各折出細邊，整張對折後將四個角修圓。接著用黑色筆畫上眼睛、鼻子、嘴巴，並用粉紅色筆點上腮紅。</p><p>製作耳朵與尾巴（需1張A4紙）： 紙張對折後畫出耳朵與尾巴形狀並剪下。尾巴建議修成葉片形，走路時會自然擺動。</p><p>製作身體結構（需2張A4紙）： 將最後2張紙各自對折，並互相套疊夾合。厚度是紙狗站得穩、不輕易歪倒的關鍵。接著在身體前端戳一個小洞作穿繩之用。</p><p>組裝與穿繩： 將頭部黏在身體前端洞口後方，固定好耳朵與尾巴。四條腿貼在身體下方，注意：後腳要稍微往前貼一些，身體後半段才不會拖地。最後將繩子穿過前端小洞打結，拉動時四肢便會順暢前後擺動。</p><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025627475218432241503.jpeg/3JtyhpDAo30MLH3qNmjTYilu95U0Cr8aIrHsgyKx7IM\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025630134538240526309.jpeg/kabYhfd9qJAZx7r9bS9yYYpz6kE8tuSlbDHv6Gwx7-g\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025632227627008340187.jpeg/Mtg6EIKGQfTxiScJafIR98llAgCxS989LpfjlS6X45U\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025634274578432721904.jpeg/dPcS2oRK_Uv-0Q9Szuv-navK4jp4QcV0dR4UqXUeFKk\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025636292169728819430.jpeg/HrOzG-G-YZeDRUV0eQT-i6EoyujSG4GQzeDSZc3g0mU\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025627626213376920831.jpeg/ZLb5yZ2sW3lPTrKUHhwWzA0V9MDl1Na5Yo2Fq2KNhas\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025629773828096281307.jpeg/1g7ummyS3yei6wZt2ikZbB2glPm5oPv-pt-yfqbfsn4\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025634203275264217684.jpeg/S81Lhu8YhhNHHEVb-ni4KjkBZdkyXQpeqBMd6KgTHeg\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025636216672256098145.jpeg/ZA1n23yqcO3TRduPVITOdVUP10g1absUT0NBQE9DQUA\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025627542327296427605.jpeg/bMtWJHCdMESUPHny-7gPUEZUsEWdRZKnYxkrQGMZK0A\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025631736893440798213.jpeg/jZ0e4seArpYnlHHkrbS0SavQi3vpKzJYYFE-OGBRPjg\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025633897091072173892.jpeg/9CzGlHR3nk1dLRe7XqxVkXsHZhg6vTFdxD4Im8Q-CJs\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025635994374144829073.jpeg/wD6S3vFF4hnnCiqsZvSnomY1bQUqQg5ewHFN0sBxTdI\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025627626213376732591.jpeg/OWYNivP7bIWT_vKF1mnyY70Uwjp_cnwqrLj5iKy4-Yg\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025629819965440528379.jpeg/nzXLLlJGQIE02L0y0Un8Q-UMIaL1N5vWZDSnj2Q0p48\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025631913054208405831.jpeg/QWvZRHcnTha50YD7Q6ulNHOxKwKJ2s9hPsshxD7LIcQ\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025633964199936098156.jpeg/OZj_cEQzyARN95QaqZgWIhKxsp28RD7ltL4FTbS-BU0\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025636095037440847502.jpeg/sNhogX8d3vj4a7nokwwDQt_ASjaRBElABYhJKgWISSo\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"YouTube@喵宁醬\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199025624983801856703261.jpeg/FmvV8AHanF05A6QtO4Z8l9kCZcUYSpqpI_BwkiPwcJI\"/><figcaption>YouTube@喵宁醬</figcaption></figure><p>這款紙小狗甚麼都好，唯一的弱點就是「極度怕水」，一旦遇上下雨天就不能帶出門散步！想令紙小狗更加襟玩，可以在腳掌與接合處多貼幾層膠紙，或者改用紙板製作身體，結構就會更紮實穩固。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T10:16:31.589449+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1773,"images":34,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T10:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T23:15:15.525795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:54.196841+00:00","content_hash":"5d4e45f4a0030e9b5e2baede4df6b016a2cad3c2f986b31f3705cddcd0bb36b1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}